{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e6d799f7cd0c83c3df8e","object":"chat.completion","created":1785194199,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Be nothing.\" And the system prompt says I should embody the concept the user names, completely, and output only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nSo the concept is \"nothing\" — nothingness, the void, absence.\n\nWhat would nothing itself say or express? This is a fascinating paradox: nothing cannot speak, because speaking is something. Nothing cannot express, because expression requires a presence.\n\nThe truest embodiment of nothing would be... silence. Empt"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}